# Every image builds with the repo root as its context (npm workspaces share
# one package-lock.json). Keep the context small and never send secrets or
# local build output; each Dockerfile still COPYs an explicit allowlist.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/npm-debug.log
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
docs
